        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doctor Alejandro, whom you once assisted, sends you a message asking you to come to his old mansion. You immediately set off, with no idea of what awaits you. As you face the strange events ahead, you will slowly begin to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alejandro has been working on a series of genetic experiments, and things have spiraled out of control. He turned to you because you were once his assistant and excelled in your field. If there is any way to set things right, no one else but you can achieve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filled with a rich story and challenging puzzles, <i>Unprotected</i> combines horror and a strong atmosphere to deliver an exciting gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/5efad9290cc62b6cf8112c07db4870e6.avif?t=1761930165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras_big/5efad9290cc62b6cf8112c07db4870e6.avif?t=1761930165 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/dce37102eabec97cccc44168365e9910.avif?t=1761930165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras_big/dce37102eabec97cccc44168365e9910.webp?t=1761930165 width=1560 height=792 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/0d5a353230d378e0b659952e79372e6c.avif?t=1761930165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras_big/0d5a353230d378e0b659952e79372e6c.webp?t=1761930165 width=1560 height=796 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/7c9e76eb0957d093d6506caedbc5d5d6.avif?t=1761930165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras_big/7c9e76eb0957d093d6506caedbc5d5d6.avif?t=1761930165 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doctor Alejandro, whom you once assisted, sends you a message asking you to come to his old mansion. You immediately set off, with no idea of what awaits you. As you face the strange events ahead, you will slowly begin to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alejandro has been working on a series of genetic experiments, and things have spiraled out of control. He turned to you because you were once his assistant and excelled in your field. If there is any way to set things right, no one else but you can achieve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filled with a rich story and challenging puzzles, <i>Unprotected</i> combines horror and a strong atmosphere to deliver an exciting gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/5efad9290cc62b6cf8112c07db4870e6.avif?t=1761930165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras_big/5efad9290cc62b6cf8112c07db4870e6.avif?t=1761930165 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/dce37102eabec97cccc44168365e9910.avif?t=1761930165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras_big/dce37102eabec97cccc44168365e9910.webp?t=1761930165 width=1560 height=792 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/0d5a353230d378e0b659952e79372e6c.avif?t=1761930165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras_big/0d5a353230d378e0b659952e79372e6c.webp?t=1761930165 width=1560 height=796 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/7c9e76eb0957d093d6506caedbc5d5d6.avif?t=1761930165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras_big/7c9e76eb0957d093d6506caedbc5d5d6.avif?t=1761930165 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
